{"t":"CARR","made":"2026-11-14 00:19","name":"Carrier Global Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Building Products & Equipment","employees":47000,"hq":"Palm Beach Gardens, FL, United States","website":"https://www.carrier.com","summary_en":"Carrier Global Corporation provides intelligent climate and energy solutions in the United States, Europe, the Asia Pacific, and internationally. It operates through four segments: Climate Solutions Americas; Climate Solutions Europe; Climate Solutions Asia Pacific, Middle East & Africa; and Climate Solutions Transportation. The company provides air conditioners, heating systems, heat pumps, home and building energy management systems, automation systems, aftermarket components, and repair and maintenance and rental services, as well as modernization and upgrades to meet the heating, cooling, and ventilation needs of residential and commercial customers. It also offers transport refrigeration and monitoring products, services, and digital solutions for trucks, trailers, shipping containers, and intermodal and rail applications. The company offers its products under the Carrier, Viessmann, Toshiba, Automated Logic, Bryant, CIAT, Day & Night, Heil, NORESCO, Carrier Transicold, and Sensitech brands. The company was incorporated in 2019 and is headquartered in Palm Beach Gardens, Florida.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Carrier Global Corporation은 미국, 유럽, 아시아 태평양 및 국제적으로 지능형 기후 및 에너지 솔루션을 제공합니다. 이는 4개 부문을 통해 운영됩니다: Climate Solutions Americas; 기후 솔루션 유럽; 기후 솔루션 아시아 태평양, 중동 및 아프리카; 기후 솔루션 운송. 이 회사는 에어컨, 난방 시스템, 열 펌프, 주택 및 건물 에너지 관리 시스템, 자동화 시스템, 애프터마켓 부품, 수리, 유지 관리, 임대 서비스를 제공할 뿐만 아니라 주거용 및 상업용 고객의 난방, 냉방 및 환기 요구 사항을 충족하기 위한 현대화 및 업그레이드도 제공합니다. 또한 트럭, 트레일러, 선적 컨테이너, 복합 운송 및 철도 응용 분야를 위한 운송용 냉동 및 모니터링 제품, 서비스 및 디지털 솔루션을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 Carrier, Viessmann, Toshiba, Automated Logic, Bryant, CIAT, Day & Night, Heil, NORESCO, Carrier Transicold 및 Sensitech 브랜드로 제품을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 2019년에 설립되었으며 플로리다주 팜비치가든스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":54.055,"mcap":44225650688.0,"pe":null,"fpe":16.984808,"peg":1.0548,"ps":1.9404024,"pb":4.4015145,"ev_ebitda":17.032,"div":1.77,"beta":1.333,"hi52":76.76,"lo52":50.24},"fin":{"rev":22791999488.0,"rev_g":0.123,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.24377,"op":0.086389996,"net":-0.07902,"roe":-0.13436,"fcf":1944125056.0,"cash":1354000000.0,"debt":11875999744.0,"de":113.962,"eps":-2.21,"feps":3.18255},"own":{"short":0.028199999,"inst":0.89638,"insider":0.04803},"analyst":{"n":23,"mean":68.70087,"median":70.0,"high":88.0,"low":55.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.07692,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":11,"hold":13,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":11,"hold":13,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":2,"buy":12,"hold":11,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":2,"buy":12,"hold":10,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Baird","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":70.0,"priorPriceTarget":72.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":60.0,"priorPriceTarget":61.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":71.0,"priorPriceTarget":80.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":65.0,"priorPriceTarget":67.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"BNP Paribas","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":60.0,"priorPriceTarget":68.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget